<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oryx Energy raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oryx Energy raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs raised its rating on Oryx Energy Co to market outperform from perform, a Goldman source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
